<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6309"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Next<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Next<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 10:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There are alot of wackos here huh? Can you believe all the religous freaks spouting Jesus? Turn yourself in. Ha Ha Ha. <BR>Why would you do that? WPD doesn&#39;t have a clue, why they are even swabbing reporters. <BR> <BR>Sometime do you wonder what is really happening and what isn&#39;t? I do. I can convince myself that it&#39;s all in my head. Is that make believe or is that real. <BR> Killing must be real. Does it connect you knowing they won&#39;t wake up? I know it makes you feel alive. Just like the adrenaline rush of planting a toasties box and watching it show up on tv. That makes it real. <BR> <BR> What did the eyes look like? I really want to know that.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6309-->
<!--Post: 6310--><!--Time: 1107670919-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6310"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W.Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 10:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK you were watching the scared glint in their eyes slowly disappear. You heard their gasps for breath.  Their bodies twitching gasping and muscles trying to convulse.  As they released their urine and bowels, did you still sit in that arena and love the smell of death?  What control of smell you must have. Was the smell of death something that gave you sexual satisfaction?  You were there at the Otero house over one hour. What were you doing?  Were you taking pictures?  Were you posing your victims? <BR> <BR>What is it about death of others that makes you so sexually excited?  You picked Shirly Vian as a second choice. Your first choice was three doors down.  That lady and her son were not at home.  Was your sexual excitement so heightened that you had to finish off by killing another woman in the same neighborhood?  Who made you kill?  Was it the monster, or was it something you learned in Vietnam?   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6310-->
<!--Post: 6311--><!--Time: 1107672096-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6311"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dorothy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dorothy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 10:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If all goes well.... <BR> <BR>You&#39;re gonna be swabbed this week.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6311-->
<!--Post: 6324--><!--Time: 1107697278-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6324"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->???<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 5:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK you may be watching. So am I.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6324-->
<!--Post: 6342--><!--Time: 1107712030-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6342"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 9:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When the weather warms up you will no longer need your long winter coat or your fake goatee or your toupee.  You really should go on a diet, you are getting thick at the waist in your old age, nothing you can do about that horseshoe hairline either.  You are even afraid to make your drops in the city now because you know the cameras are watching your every move.  Cameras in parking lots, cameras at the banks, stores, everywhere these days there are cameras...even the traffic lights.  It appears you are losing your creativity also.  Stuffing things in cereal boxes, plastic bags...you really need to come up with something to wow us folks...valentines day is coming soon...how about using a heart shaped candy box...and for easter you can use a basket, those are the kinds of things people notice, not a old cereal box and plastic bag...get with the program and use a little imagination.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6342-->
<!--Post: 6398--><!--Time: 1107753310-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6398"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->W.Hammer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 9:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK <BR> <BR>I realize you are listening to ideas on the BTK boards. I see you used some of the ideas that people talked about.  I know you are somewhat in control of your destiny, but the cancer is taking it&#39;s toll. You need to come forward before you are taken into custody. You may not be heard as you wish you could be heard. <BR> <BR>This week, you need to send a Valentines Card to the two reporters that have had colds.  Put the words.....  I am deathly sick..... in your next communication to KAKE. Be honest and truthful.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6398-->
<!--Post: 6405--><!--Time: 1107756123-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6405"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 10:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: <BR> <BR>So, if it is really you leaving all those messages on the &#34;from btk&#34; board and you really our right under our noses, excuse me while I sneeze on you, as I too, have a cold.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6405-->
<!--Post: 6419--><!--Time: 1107775891-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6419"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 3:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK - I obviously do not know if you are posting here or not, but if you are - you should be aware that just &#39;getting by with murder&#39; does not make you a smart boy.   <BR> <BR>Go ahead and say that the PD, FBI and CIA are off-track, although I don&#39;t think the CIA gives two hoots about your game.   <BR> <BR>But we&#39;re not off track - we the posters here.  We don&#39;t have the same evidence the aforementioned do.  You would not be playing your games if we did. You won&#39;t match wits with us directly because you KNOW better.   <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t care about your double letters and inuendo.  I don&#39;t care about what you place in cereal boxes. <BR> <BR>I want to know WHY you did what you did.  I want to know why you are doing what you are doing now.  I want to know what is inside your head.  I want to know how you grew up and the events that transpired that are and are not related to your killings.   <BR> <BR>You&#39;re not giving me anything of substance - so don&#39;t be surprised if I don&#39;t take part in your puzzles.  Why should any of us expend energy when we don&#39;t even know who the author is?   <BR> <BR>BTK - the REAL you - could be long dead.  A silly, misguided youngster could have found your stash, propagating all the games.   <BR> <BR>More and more everyday this entire scenario takes on a cartoon-like facade.   <BR> <BR>Forgive me - but I have never liked cartoons, not even as a child.   <BR> <BR>What are you doing?  Driving around and using other&#39;s wireless signals?  Is that why the posts are short?  You&#39;ve got to be moving on to the next one...?  Stopping at red lights, maybe?   <BR> <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6419-->
<!--Post: 6424--><!--Time: 1107780672-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6424"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 4:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So, btk or his imposter, are you finally communicating with this website? How do we know it&#39;s you? Why did you isolate Freya&#39;s post. Didn&#39;t you like her\his post? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6424-->
<!--Post: 6425--><!--Time: 1107782045-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6425"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 5:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->btk you said you wanted to Freya something. Are you a repairman?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6425-->
<!--Post: 6451--><!--Time: 1107798917-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6451"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 9:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, <BR> <BR>I agree.  Have had my own experiences with the police.  Not the top of the &#34;novel&#34; thinking barrel, if you know what I mean. <BR> <BR>Who&#39;s your favorite poet? <BR> <BR>THANKS, <BR>Susan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6451-->
<!--Post: 6480--><!--Time: 1107816648-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6480"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 2:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK....do you, or is it your father that owns a string of car washes in Wichita?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6480-->
<!--Post: 6504--><!--Time: 1107838639-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6504"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 07, 2005 - 8:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Will Susan be your final victim? Will you love her to death? She looks like Vicki. Sometimes the people we love don&#39;t even give us the time of day, do they? It is sad when all you want is to see them, to touch them, to be with them. Every second with them is a lifetime of answered prayer. Does she know how you feel? BTK, are you a PK?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6504-->
